 small{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;color:#6B7686;font:700 11px/1 Barlow,Inter,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}#applications .applications-cell p{margin:0;color:#3C4858;font-size:15px;line-height:1.68}#applications .applications-pain{padding-left:14px;border-left:3px solid #C8161C}#applications .applications-chipset{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}#applications .applications-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #E2E7EE;background:#EAEEF4;color:#143A7B;font:700 13px/1.2 Barlow,Inter,Arial,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}#applications .applications-chip svg{width:14px;height:14px;fill:currentColor}#applications .applications-outcome{display:flex;gap:10px}#applications .applications-outcome svg{width:16px;height:16px;flex:0 0 16px;fill:#C8161C;margin-top:4px}#applications .applications-note{margin-top:18px;color:#6B7686;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}#applications .applications-note strong{color:#143A7B} @media (max-width:760px){#applications{padding:56px 0}#applications .applications-head{margin-bottom:22px}#applications .applications-proof{grid-template-columns:1fr}#applications .applications-lane{grid-template-columns:1fr}#applications .applications-marker{justify-content:flex-start;padding:12px 18px;font-size:18px}#applications .applications-body{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;padding:18px}#applications .applications-pain{padding-left:12px}}</style><div class=\"applications-wrap ai-wrap\"><div class=\"applications-head ai-section-head\"><div class=\"applications-eyebrow\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#icon-globe\"></use></svg><span>Applications</span></div><h2>Scenario-led website optimization for export sales teams</h2><p>When product lines are not the problem, the buying path usually is. Xunpanyun aligns operating context, buyer friction, and the right B2B website upgrade so overseas traffic turns into qualified inquiries.</p></div><div class=\"applications-proof\"><div><strong>Built for foreign trade</strong><span>SEO structure, inquiry capture, and page conversion tuned for industrial B2B exporters.</span></div><div><strong>Delivery logic</strong><span>Each upgrade maps to a commercial scenario, not a generic redesign checklist.</span></div></div><div class=\"applications-lanes\"><article class=\"applications-lane\"><div class=\"applications-marker\">01</div><div class=\"applications-body\"><div class=\"applications-cell\"><small>Operating environment</small><p>Entering a new market with low Google visibility and thin category coverage.</p></div><div class=\"applications-cell applications-pain\"><small>Pain point</small><p>Buyers cannot find relevant pages for exact use cases or keywords.</p></div><div class=\"applications-cell\"><small>Suitable product</small><div class=\"applications-chipset\"><span class=\"applications-chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#icon-cube\"></use></svg>B2B SEO Architecture</span></div></div><div class=\"applications-cell applications-outcome\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#icon-check\"></use></svg><p>More indexed pages and steadier inbound traffic from target industries.</p></div></div></article><article class=\"applications-lane\"><div class=\"applications-marker\">02</div><div class=\"applications-body\"><div class=\"applications-cell\"><small>Operating environment</small><p>Distributor outreach and RFQ campaigns driving mixed-intent visitors.</p></div><div class=\"applications-cell applications-pain\"><small>Pain point</small><p>Generic pages fail to separate serious buyers from casual browsing.</p></div><div class=\"applications-cell\"><small>Suitable product</small><div class=\"applications-chipset\"><span class=\"applications-chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#icon-send\"></use></svg>Inquiry Conversion Pages</span></div></div><div class=\"applications-cell applications-outcome\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#icon-check\"></use></svg><p>Cleaner inquiry forms and higher-quality leads for sales follow-up.</p></div></div></article><article class=\"applications-lane\"><div class=\"applications-marker\">03</div><div class=\"applications-body\"><div class=\"applications-cell\"><small>Operating environment</small><p>Complex industrial catalogs sold across regions, applications, and spec standards.</p></div><div class=\"applications-cell applications-pain\"><small>Pain point</small><p>Technical value is lost because pages do not explain fit quickly in English.</p></div><div class=\"applications-cell\"><small>Suitable product</small><div class=\"applications-chipset\"><span class=\"applications-chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#icon-globe\"></use></svg>Multilingual Content Optimization</span></div></div><div class=\"applications-cell applications-outcome\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#icon-check\"></use></svg><p>Buyers understand applications faster and stay longer on key pages.</p></div></div></article><article class=\"applications-lane\"><div class=\"applications-marker\">04</div><div class=\"applications-body\"><div class=\"applications-cell\"><small>Operating environment</small><p>Long sales cycles where initial inquiries often stall after the first reply.</p></div><div class=\"applications-cell applications-pain\"><small>Pain point</small><p>Website messaging does not help procurement teams move toward quotation.</p></div><div class=\"applications-cell\"><small>Suitable product</small><div class=\"applications-chipset\"><span class=\"applications-chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#icon-arrow-right\"></use></svg>Quote-Ready Funnel Pages</span></div></div><div class=\"applications-cell applications-outcome\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#icon-check\"></use></svg><p>Shorter handoff time from marketing inquiry to sales-ready opportunity.</p></div></div></article></div><p class=\"applications-note\"><strong>Use case logic:</strong> match search intent, proof depth, and inquiry friction to the exact export scenario before scaling traffic.</p></div></section>\n<!-- /wp:acf/applications -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/about-us {\"name\":\"acf/about-us\",\"data\":{\"eyebrow\":\"About Us\",\"_eyebrow\":\"field_goodjob_about_us_eyebrow\",\"title\":\"A practical export growth system built for B2B manufacturers\",\"_title\":\"field_goodjob_about_us_title\",\"intro\":\"询盘云 helps industrial exporters turn websites into qualified inquiry channels. We combine SEO-led structure, conversion-focused content, and disciplined export communication so your online presence supports real manufacturing business, not just traffic.\",\"_intro\":\"field_goodjob_about_us_intro\",\"primary_label\":\"Request a Proposal\",\"_primary_label\":\"field_goodjob_about_us_primary_label\",\"primary_url\":\"#contact-us\",\"_primary_url\":\"field_goodjob_about_us_primary_url\",\"html_source\":\"\",\"_html_source\":\"field_goodjob_about_us_html_source\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} -->\n<section id=\"about-us\" class=\"ai-section about-us-capability-stack-and-quality-process\"><style>#about-us{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff 0%,#f4f6fa 100%);color:#16202E;}#about-us .about-us-wrap{width:min(1440px,calc(100vw - clamp(32px,6vw,120px)));margin:auto;}#about-us .about-us-head{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 28px;}#about-us .about-us-eyebrow{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:10px;color:#C8161C;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;}#about-us .about-us-title{margin:0;font-family:Barlow Semi Condensed, Barlow, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px);line-height:1.05;color:#091B39;max-width:12ch;}#about-us .about-us-intro{margin:14px 0 0;max-width:64ch;color:#3C4858;font-size:clamp(16px,1.2vw,17px);line-height:1.72;}#about-us .about-us-proof-band{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .95fr;gap:clamp(18px,3vw,32px);align-items:stretch;margin-top:30px;}#about-us .about-us-panel{background:#091B39;border:1px solid rgba(255,2